  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"3077c488-50e7-4951-8263-624e529ece4a\">\n  <div class=\"poem\">\n    <p><strong>Come, Holy Spirit, heavenly Dove,</strong><br>\n    With all Thy quick’ning powers;<br>\n    Kindle a flame of sacred love<br>\n    In these cold hearts of ours.</p>\n\n    <p>Look how we grovel here below,<br>\n    Fond of these trifling toys;<br>\n    Our souls can neither fly nor go<br>\n    To reach eternal joys.</p>\n\n    <p>In vain we tune our formal songs,<br>\n    In vain we strive to rise;<br>\n    Hosannas languish on our tongues,<br>\n    And our devotion dies.</p>\n\n    <p>Dear Lord! and shall we ever live<br>\n    At this poor dying rate?<br>\n    Our love so faint, so cold to Thee,<br>\n    And Thine to us so great!</p>\n\n    <p>Come, Holy Spirit, heavenly Dove,<br>\n    With all Thy quick’ning powers;<br>\n    Come, shed abroad the Savior’s love<br>\n    And that shall kindle ours.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"byline\">Isaac Watts (1674-1748)</p>\n  </div>\n</article>\n",
